{"artifactPath":".agents/lease-ownership.md","content":"## 3. Expiry and takeover

An expired lease does not prove completion. It proves only missing heartbeat beyond expiry. Takeover requires:

- evidence that prior owner is inactive or blocked;
- a new lease acquire event;
- causal ref to the expired lease;
- parent or root authority for risky takeover.
","contentSha256":"9a7719f9e9a765d6f8ebccdc8f05a0d85071db2f50eaf3cf16cc047fd8f978c2","decidedAt":"2026-05-14T20:05:00+09:00","eventId"

