{"artifactPath":".agents/protocol-fsm.md","content":"## 3. Blocked states

Blockers are first-class protocol transitions. A blocker MUST include:

- blocker class;
- required owner;
- escalation level;
- forbidden actions until resolved;
- required resolution event.

A blocked actor may resume only when the required owner has appended the resolution event named by the blocker.
","contentSha256":"7f6b7b475e3151695c4f0105dacfd28611ff740c9cdfe33f7708c3165296d7b7","decidedAt":"2026-05-14T

